<title>USA: Westernbank sets semi-annual div $0.09.</title>
<headline>Westernbank sets semi-annual div $0.09.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westernbank Puerto Rico said it declared a semi-annual dividend of $0.09 per share.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable on July 15 to shareholders of record on June 30.</p>
<p>The prior cash dividend was $0.17 per share paid on January 15.</p>
<p>In addition to the prior cash dividend, the bank also paid a 15 percent stock dividend and a two-for-one stock split on March 3.</p>
<p>Westernbank is a Puerto Rican bank with 31 branches.</p>
</text>
